IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-ZMM-ZEROCOPY-V1.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-VECTORS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BATCH-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ACTIVE-LANES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ZMM-ZEROCOPY-V1.
    IF NUM-VECTORS == 0 OR BATCH-SIZE == 0 OR ACTIVE-LANES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 52400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-VECTORS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
